    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "68ef748d-ea70-491d-a4d0-cc647068c3e5",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Vengence for the beloved",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102441231935",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository edad702b-5b37-4dc1-a47c-36a1588f1d3f).Image",
        "Description": "47, Helmut Kruger is a legendary supermodel, and now he now wants to take a step back and own his own brand. But Mrs. Margolis has other plans. Unfortunately, what Mr. Kruger has in good looks, is lacking in his ability to stand up to those who wrong him.\r\rYour mission is to assume the position of Mr. Kruger and take out his enemies:\rHis Photographer who insists on shooting his bad side.\rA pair of guards who have a habit of saying strange things to him.\rAnd Mrs. Margolis herself.\r\rGood luck, 47",
